  "fullDescription": "2026–2027 Calendar Planner Mega Bundle | Sep 2026–Dec 2027, 70 Weekly Planners, A4 & US Letter\nPlan continuously from September 2026 through December 2027 with this complete printable Calendar & Planner Mega Bundle.\n\nDesigned as a cohesive 16-month planning system, this collection combines dated monthly calendars with reusable weekly planning pages so you can start organizing immediately instead of waiting until January.\n\nThe bundle includes 4 coordinated design editions — Sage Green, Dusty Blue, Earth Tone and Ink-Friendly — with every edition supplied in A4 and US Letter, plus dedicated Portrait and Landscape layouts.\n\nEach complete planner contains 87 pages, combining September–December 2026 planning pages with the full January–December 2027 planner.\n\nPlan 16 continuous months\n\nCoverage includes:\n\nSeptember 2026\nOctober 2026\nNovember 2026\nDecember 2026\nJanuary–December 2027\n\nMonthly planning\n\nThe bundle contains 16 dated monthly calendar overviews, each designed with practical planning space for:\n\nMonthly priorities\nMonthly goals\nNotes\nAppointments\nDeadlines\nImportant dates\nPersonal and business planning\nWeekly planning\n\nAlso included are 70 weekly planner pages:\n\n18 weekly planners for the September–December 2026 extension\n52 weekly planners for 2027\n\nWeekly pages include:\n\nMonday–Sunday planning sections\nDate Range\nWeekly Focus\nTop Priorities\nGoals\nNotes\nFour coordinated styles\n\nChoose from:\n\nSage Green — soft, calm and minimal\nDusty Blue — clean and professional\nEarth Tone — warm and natural\nInk-Friendly — simplified for economical home printing\n\nFlexible printing formats\n\nEvery edition is supplied in:\n\nA4 Portrait\nA4 Landscape\nUS Letter Portrait\nUS Letter Landscape\n\nPerfect for:\n\nPersonal organization\nBusiness planning\nHome management\nStudents\nTeachers\nFreelancers\nCreators\nGoal planning\nProject planning\nFamily organization\nProductivity planning\nYear-end planning\nNew-year preparation\n\nStart in September 2026 and continue planning seamlessly through December 2027.\n\nDigital download only. No physical product will be shipped.\n\nColors may vary slightly depending on your monitor, printer, ink and paper settings.\n16-MONTH PLANNING SYSTEM\nSeptember 2026–December 2027\n\n16 Monthly Calendars\n70 Weekly Planners\n1 Year-at-a-Glance\n\n4 Styles\nSage • Dusty Blue • Earth Tone • Ink-Friendly\n\n2 Sizes\nA4 + US Letter\n\n2 Orientations\nPortrait + Landscape\n\n16 PDFs • 87 Pages Each",
